          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>(To) His excellency, the most illustrious Sheikh, my master,</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Is\u1e25\u0101q Abraham, son of</li>\n<li>his honor, great and holy master Pera\u1e25ya b. Yij\u016b from al-Mahdiyya</li>\n<li>may he rest in Eden the Garden!</li></ol>\n",
